  ============================================================================
  SSF HP HERO TAKEOVER  —  self-contained hero block for Kentico
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Built to exact Figma specs (nodes 3615:128009 / 132802 / 129016).
  • Paste the <style> + <section> into a Kentico static-HTML / code widget.
  • Host the 3 SVG assets and update the paths in --anim-desktop / --anim-mobile
    and the mobile background url():
      assets/hero-animation-desktop.svg   (680x456, animated)
      assets/hero-animation-mobile.svg    (390x212, animated)
      assets/bkg-mobile.svg               (395x768, mobile bg gradients + dots)
  • Montserrat (400/700/800) from Google Fonts; drop the <link> if the site
    already ships it. The global site nav is NOT included (Kentico header owns it).

  Exact type / layout anchors:
                       Large 1920        Mid 1440         Mobile 395
    eyebrow            16px /.48         14px /.42        12px /.36  (Bold, upper)
    headline           72px             46px             28px  (ExtraBold 800)
    body               24px /1.6        18px /1.6        16px /1.5 (Regular)
    graphic            816x547 @top165  680x456 @top101  390x212 (below copy)
    hero height        877              658              stacked
  ============================================================================
-->
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

<style>
  .ssf-hero *, .ssf-hero *::before, .ssf-hero *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  .ssf-hero {
    --orange: #FF4200;
    --divider: #333333;
    --dots: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,66,0,0.85) 0.85px, transparent 1.5px);
    --dot-size: 27px;   /* measured Figma dot pitch */
    /* Graphic width + text-to-image gap (mid desktop 768–1919).
       gap floor is 24px so the copy can never overlap the image.            */
    --graphic-w: clamp(360px, min(calc(28.33vw + 272px), 47vw), 816px);
    --gap: clamp(24px, 2vw, 40px);
    position: relative;
    background: #000;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: "Montserrat", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ===================== STAGE (hero area above stats) ===================== */
  .ssf-hero__stage {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: clamp(600px, 45.7vw, 877px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    /* orange radial glows (Ellipse 13 behind product, 14 bottom-left, 15 center)
       — base = mid 1440 frame geometry; each ellipse fades center->edge.       */
    background:
      radial-gradient(61% 116% at 133% 39%, rgba(255,66,0,0.72) 0%, rgba(255,66,0,0) 100%),
      radial-gradient(78% 101% at -46% 101%, rgba(255,66,0,0.50) 0%, rgba(255,66,0,0) 100%),
      radial-gradient(17% 38%  at 65% 63%,  rgba(255,66,0,0.38) 0%, rgba(255,66,0,0) 100%);
  }

  /* ---- dot-grid clusters (positioned per Figma frame coords, % of stage) ----
     Base = mid 1440 frame; each cluster fades from its centre to its edge.      */
  .ssf-dots { position: absolute; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
    background-image: var(--dots); background-size: var(--dot-size) var(--dot-size);
    -webkit-mask: radial-gradient(closest-side, #000 0%, transparent 100%);
    mask: radial-gradient(closest-side, #000 0%, transparent 100%); }
  .ssf-dots--bl { left: -16.3%; top: 56.7%; width: 40.4%; height: 90.9%; }
  .ssf-dots--tr { left: 78.4%;  top: -31.3%; width: 40.4%; height: 90.9%; }
  .ssf-dots--ctr{ left: 43.6%;  top: 34.5%; width: 32.8%; height: 73.7%; }

  /* ============================ COPY COLUMN ============================ */
  .ssf-hero__inner {
    position: relative; z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;   /* right-align copy against the image */
    padding-left: clamp(24px, 9.4vw, 135px);
    /* reserve image width + gap on the right so copy stops >=24px before it */
    padding-right: calc(var(--graphic-w) + var(--gap));
    padding-top: clamp(40px, 4vw, 64px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(40px, 4vw, 64px);
  }
  .ssf-hero__content { max-width: clamp(560px, calc(61vw - 280px), 892px); min-width: 0; }

  /* Extra large (>=1920): image grows with the viewport, and the copy moves
     farther from it — gap scales up to a 400px maximum.                       */
  @media (min-width: 1920px) {
    .ssf-hero {
      --graphic-w: clamp(816px, calc(28.33vw + 272px), 1200px);
      --gap: clamp(24px, calc(30vw - 492px), 720px);
    }
    /* glows + dot clusters repositioned to the XL 1920 frame geometry */
    .ssf-hero__stage {
      background:
        radial-gradient(46% 87%   at 115% 39%, rgba(255,66,0,0.72) 0%, rgba(255,66,0,0) 100%),
        radial-gradient(59% 76%   at -34% 76%, rgba(255,66,0,0.50) 0%, rgba(255,66,0,0) 100%),
        radial-gradient(13% 28.5% at calc(60% + 84px) 71%, rgba(255,66,0,0.20) 0%, rgba(255,66,0,0) 100%);
    }
    .ssf-dots--bl { left: 0.3%;  top: 55.1%; width: 30.3%; height: 68.2%; }
    .ssf-dots--tr { left: 71.3%; top: -10.9%; width: 30.3%; height: 68.2%; }
    .ssf-dots--ctr{ left: calc(43.9% + 84px); top: 49.4%; width: 24.6%; height: 55.3%; opacity: 0.45; }
  }

  .ssf-hero__eyebrow {
    color: var(--orange);
    font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: clamp(14px, calc(0.417vw + 8px), 16px);
    line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .ssf-hero__title {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(46px, calc(5.42vw - 32px), 72px);
    line-height: 1.3; color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .ssf-hero__body {
    font-weight: 400; color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.25vw, 24px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: clamp(430px, calc(17.9vw + 316px), 660px);
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }

  /* ============================== CTAs ============================== */
  .ssf-hero__ctas { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; }
  .ssf-btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;
    padding: 16.5px 30px; border: 1px solid transparent; cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color .18s ease, color .18s ease, border-color .18s ease;
  }
  .ssf-btn--primary   { background: var(--orange); color: #000; }
  .ssf-btn--primary:hover { background: #fff; color: #000; }
  .ssf-btn--secondary { background: transparent; color: #fff; border-color: #fff; }
  .ssf-btn--secondary:hover { background: #fff; color: #000; border-color: #fff; }

  /* ============================= GRAPHIC ============================= */
  .ssf-hero__graphic {
    position: absolute; z-index: 1;
    top: 50%; right: 0; transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: var(--graphic-w);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .ssf-hero__graphic img { width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .ssf-hero__graphic--desktop { display: block; }
  .ssf-hero__graphic--mobile  { display: none; }

  /* ============================ STATS BAR ============================ */
  .ssf-hero__stats {
    background: #000;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
    padding: 36px clamp(24px, 5vw, 60px);
  }
  .ssf-hero__stats-inner {
    max-width: 1170px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: clamp(24px, 4.4vw, 64px);
  }
  .ssf-stat {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--divider);
    padding: 9px 40px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .ssf-stat__value { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: #fff; white-space: nowrap; }
  .ssf-stat__label { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; color: #B1B1B1; white-space: nowrap; }

  /* mobile-only forced line breaks (hidden on desktop) */
  .ssf-br-mobile { display: none; }

  /* ===================================================================
     MID DESKTOP tightening (≤1200): let stats breathe, shrink padding
     =================================================================== */
  @media (max-width: 1200px) {
    /* tighten spacing and allow labels to wrap so the 4-up row never clips */
    .ssf-hero__stats-inner { gap: clamp(16px, 2vw, 32px); }
    .ssf-stat { padding: 9px 16px; }
    .ssf-stat__label { white-space: normal; }

    /* mobile/tablet background art replaces the desktop orange glows */
    .ssf-hero {
      background-color: #000;
      background-image: url("/media/NT/media/images/SSF-Assets/bkg-mobile-hp-takeover.svg");
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-position: top center;
      background-size: 100% auto;
    }
    .ssf-hero__stage { background: none; }
  }

  /* ===================================================================
     MOBILE  (<768)
     =================================================================== */
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .ssf-hero__stage {
      display: block; min-height: 0; overflow: visible;
      background: none;
    }
    .ssf-dots { display: none; }

    .ssf-hero__inner {
      display: block;
      padding: 44px 24px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .ssf-hero__content { max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; }
    .ssf-hero__eyebrow { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.03em; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .ssf-hero__title { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .ssf-hero__body { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto 32px; }

    .ssf-hero__ctas { flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
    .ssf-btn { width: 100%; }

    /* graphic: static, below copy, mobile animation */
    .ssf-br-mobile { display: inline; }

    .ssf-hero__graphic {
      position: static; transform: none; width: 100%;
      max-width: 390px;
      margin: 32px auto 48px;
    }
    .ssf-hero__graphic--desktop { display: none; }
    .ssf-hero__graphic--mobile  { display: block; }

    /* stats: 2 x 2 grid with cross dividers */
    .ssf-hero__stats { padding: 0; border: none; }
    .ssf-hero__stats-inner {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
    }
    .ssf-stat {
      border-left: none; padding: 22px 12px; text-align: center;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
    }
    .ssf-stat:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 1px solid var(--divider); }
    .ssf-stat:nth-child(3), .ssf-stat:nth-child(4) { border-bottom: none; }
    .ssf-stat__value { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .ssf-stat__label { font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; }
  }
</style>

<section class="ssf-hero" aria-label="Single Stock Futures hero">
  <div class="ssf-hero__stage">
    <div class="ssf-dots ssf-dots--bl"  aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ssf-dots ssf-dots--tr"  aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ssf-dots ssf-dots--ctr" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="ssf-hero__inner">
      <div class="ssf-hero__content">
        <p class="ssf-hero__eyebrow">CME Group Listed Single Stock Futures</p>
        <h1 class="ssf-hero__title">Trade the stocks you love. Futures-style.</h1>
        <p class="ssf-hero__body">Go beyond the index and trade the names that move the market&mdash;Apple, Nvidia, Tesla, and more.</p>
        <div class="ssf-hero__ctas">
          <a class="ssf-btn ssf-btn--primary" href="https://account.ninjatrader.com/register/?utm_campaign=org-nt-us&utm_source=website&utm_medium=nt-hero&utm_content=ssf-launch&utm_term=nt-hero">Start Trading</a>
          <a class="ssf-btn ssf-btn--secondary" href="/single-stock-futures/?utm_campaign=org-nt-us&amp;utm_source=website&amp;utm_medium=nt-hero&amp;utm_content=ssf-launch&amp;utm_term=nt-hero">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ssf-hero__graphic" aria-hidden="true">
      <!-- <picture> instead of two CSS-toggled <img>: display:none does NOT stop an <img src> from
           downloading, so mobile was fetching the desktop hero (3.5 MB over the wire) on top of the
           mobile one. A <source media> makes the browser pick exactly one. fetchpriority=high raises
           its fetch priority; it does NOT designate the LCP element (the browser picks that,
           and on the 2026-08-20 desktop preview run the LCP element was the header logo). No width/height here on purpose: the two sources have different
           intrinsic ratios (680x456 vs 390x212) and a fixed pair would break the mobile aspect. -->
      <picture>
        <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="/media/NT/media/images/SSF-Assets/hero-animation-mobile-sharp.svg">
        <img class="ssf-hero__graphic--img" src="/media/NT/media/images/SSF-Assets/hero-animation-desktop.svg" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
      </picture>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ssf-hero__stats">
    <div class="ssf-hero__stats-inner">
      <div class="ssf-stat"><div class="ssf-stat__value">Nearly 23/5</div><div class="ssf-stat__label">Trade around <br class="ssf-br-mobile">the clock</div></div>
      <div class="ssf-stat"><div class="ssf-stat__value">From $0.09</div><div class="ssf-stat__label">Commissions <br class="ssf-br-mobile">per contract*</div></div>
      <div class="ssf-stat"><div class="ssf-stat__value">No Greeks</div><div class="ssf-stat__label">No time decay, <br class="ssf-br-mobile">no chains</div></div>
      <div class="ssf-stat"><div class="ssf-stat__value">Risk-Free Sim</div><div class="ssf-stat__label">Practice before <br class="ssf-br-mobile">you go live</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section-container section-container--white section-container section-container">  <div class="container"> <div class="side-by-side"> <div class="side-by-side__image clipped-image blue-underlay"> <video src="/media/getmedia/2b89376d-d4c8-4c5e-abfa-cebd9ca408a8/NT-Gif.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-hidden="true"></video> </div> <div class="side-by-side__content">  <h2 class="side-by-side__title">Uncover your opportunity with award-winning futures trading platforms</h2> <div class="side-by-side__text-block blue-checkmark"><p>NinjaTrader delivers integrated multi-device trading using a cloud-based technology designed for active futures traders. Take control of your trading journey and trade how you want, where you want.</p><ul><li>Access the world’s most popular futures markets including the E-mini indexes.</li><li>Trade futures seamlessly across devices including PC, Mac or mobile.</li><li>Visualize the futures markets and target trades using a customizable futures trading platform.</li><li>Join a community of over 2 million users that have made NinjaTrader the #1 rated futures broker.</li></ul></div> <a class="button button-orange" href="https://account.ninjatrader.com/register" target="_blank"> Open Account </a> </div> </div> </div> </section><section class="section-container section-container--white section-container section-container">  <div class="container"> <div class="infographic dark"> <div class="infographic__top"> <div class="infographic__top-text"> <h2 class="infographic__title">Clear savings for futures traders</h2> <div class="infographic__desc"><p id="isPasted">Get started with $50 margins and commissions as low as $.09 for Micro contracts.</p></div> </div> <div class="infographic-buttons-desktop"> <button class="infographic-buttons__button active" type="button" data-expander="tab-clear-savings-for-futures-traders-0" data-expander-hold data-expander-tabs data-expander-css data-expander-nofocus aria-expanded="true"> <span>Micro E-minis</span> </button><button class="infographic-buttons__button" type="button" data-expander="tab-clear-savings-for-futures-traders-1" data-expander-hold data-expander-tabs data-expander-css data-expander-nofocus aria-expanded="false"> <span>Micro Crude Oil</span> </button><button class="infographic-buttons__button" type="button" data-expander="tab-clear-savings-for-futures-traders-2" data-expander-hold data-expander-tabs data-expander-css data-expander-nofocus aria-expanded="false"> <span>Micro Bitcoin</span> </button> </div> </div> <div class="infographic-buttons-mobile"> <button class="infographic-buttons--mobile active" type="button" data-expander="tab-clear-savings-for-futures-traders-0" data-expander-hold data-expander-tabs data-expander-css data-expander-nofocus aria-expanded="true"> <span>Micro E-minis</span> <div class="accordion-plus"> <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"> <use xlink:href="/assets/dist/images/svg-legend.svg#plus2"></use> </svg> </div> <div class="accordion-minus"> <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"> <use xlink:href="/assets/dist/images/svg-legend.svg#minus2"></use> </svg> </div> </button> <div class="infographic__content active" id="tab-clear-savings-for-futures-traders-0" data-expander-target> <div class="infographic__flex-wrapper"> <div class="infographic__textbox"> <h3 class="infographic__content-title">Trade the same markets as Wall Street at a fraction of the cost</h3> <div class="infographic__content-block"><strong>Why trade Micro E-Mini futures?&nbsp;</strong>At 1/10th the size of the E-minis, Micro E-mini futures allow <a href="/futures">active futures traders</a> to access highly liquid equity index futures markets at reduced costs.</div> <a class="button button-white" href="/futures/futures-contracts/micro-emini-futures" target="_self"> Learn More </a> </div> <div class="infographic__imgbox"> <img src="/media/getmedia/d6065a05-743d-42e3-bdd6-271bb320421f/Surface-Device.png" alt="Ninja Trader Desktop Platform" loading="lazy"> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="infographic-buttons-mobile"> <button class="infographic-buttons--mobile" type="button" data-expander="tab-clear-savings-for-futures-traders-1" data-expander-hold data-expander-tabs data-expander-css data-expander-nofocus aria-expanded="false"> <span>Micro Crude Oil</span> <div class="accordion-plus"> <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"> <use xlink:href="/assets/dist/images/svg-legend.svg#plus2"></use> </svg> </div> <div class="accordion-minus"> <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"> <use xlink:href="/assets/dist/images/svg-legend.svg#minus2"></use> </svg> </div> </button> <div class="infographic__content" id="tab-clear-savings-for-futures-traders-1" data-expander-target> <div class="infographic__flex-wrapper"> <div class="infographic__textbox"> <h3 class="infographic__content-title">Target opportunities in the world’s most popular oil market</h3> <div class="infographic__content-block"><strong>Why trade Micro Crude Oil futures?</strong> Trade with&nbsp;only $100 margins&nbsp;and control a larger contract value in the world&rsquo;s most popular oil marketplace through leverage.<br />
<span style="font-size:11px;"><em>Leverage also increases the risk associated with futures trading and only risk capital should be used for trading.</em></span></div> <a class="button button-white" href="/futures/futures-contracts/energy/crude-oil/micro-crude-oil/" target="_self"> Learn More </a> </div> <div class="infographic__imgbox"> <img src="/media/getmedia/e8eca4f4-3ff5-48eb-8974-da3f6377c1d7/HP-Envy01-web-dark-1-slider-510px.png" alt="Ninja Trader Desktop Platform" loading="lazy"> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="infographic-buttons-mobile"> <button class="infographic-buttons--mobile" type="button" data-expander="tab-clear-savings-for-futures-traders-2" data-expander-hold data-expander-tabs data-expander-css data-expander-nofocus aria-expanded="false"> <span>Micro Bitcoin</span> <div class="accordion-plus"> <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"> <use xlink:href="/assets/dist/images/svg-legend.svg#plus2"></use> </svg> </div> <div class="accordion-minus"> <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"> <use xlink:href="/assets/dist/images/svg-legend.svg#minus2"></use> </svg> </div> </button> <div class="infographic__content" id="tab-clear-savings-for-futures-traders-2" data-expander-target> <div class="infographic__flex-wrapper"> <div class="infographic__textbox"> <h3 class="infographic__content-title">Trade Bitcoin futures with professional tools and analysis</h3> <div class="infographic__content-block"><strong>Why trade Micro Bitcoin futures? </strong>Trade easily on your Bitcoin market view through CME Group&rsquo;s regulated and centralized exchange with managed risk.</div> <a class="button button-white" href="/futures/futures-contracts/cryptocurrency/bitcoin/micro-bitcoin/" target="_self"> Learn More </a> </div> <div class="infographic__imgbox"> <img src="/media/getmedia/9d85be0d-53bb-4e65-93ff-44f484ed50cc/iphone-light-right-1-tab-510px.png" alt="Ninja Trader Desktop Platform" loading="lazy"> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="section-container section-container--white section-container section-container"> <div class="container"><!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>NinjaTrader — Diversification Callout</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;600&display=swap">
<style>
  /* ============================================================
     NinjaTrader homepage — Diversification Feature Callout
     Insert after "Clear Savings for Futures Traders" (dark block),
     before "Why Trade Futures with NinjaTrader?" (feature grid).
     Self-contained: all styles are namespaced under .nt-diversify.
     ============================================================ */
  .nt-diversify *,
  .nt-diversify *::before,
  .nt-diversify *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  .nt-diversify {
    position: relative;
    background: transparent;         /* inherits the homepage background */
    padding: 104px 0;
    color: #232323;
  }

  .nt-diversify__inner {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr;
    gap: 72px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .nt-diversify__heading {
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 50.4px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .nt-diversify__heading span { color: #000000; }

  .nt-diversify__body {
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 25.2px;
    color: #000000;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 0 36px;
  }

  .nt-diversify__cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 17px;
    letter-spacing: 2.8px;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #000000;
    background: #FF4200;
    padding: 16px 26px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background .15s, color .15s;
  }
  .nt-diversify__cta:hover { background: #DC3900; color: #ffffff; }

  /* ---- light market panel (matches the site's white icon-card sections, e.g.
        "Trade global markets with futures contracts") ---- */
  .nt-diversify__panel {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid #EAEAEA;
    background: #FAFAFA;
    padding: 22px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .nt-diversify__panelhead {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .nt-diversify__panelhead span {
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A7A7A;
  }
  .nt-diversify__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .nt-diversify__tile {
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 18px 16px;
    border: 1px solid #EAEAEA;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
    transition: border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s, transform .15s;
  }
  .nt-diversify__tile:hover {
    border-color: #FF4200;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(255,66,0,.12);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  /* Single Stock Futures sits alone on the final row — span both columns */
  .nt-diversify__tile.wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .nt-diversify__tiletop { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  /* Same icon assets NinjaTrader already uses on /futures/futures-contracts/ —
     no colored circle, no icon font: plain image, same as the rest of the site. */
  .nt-diversify__tile img.nt-diversify__icon {
    display: block;
    height: 34px;
    width: auto;
  }
  .nt-diversify__go {
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #C7C7C7;
    transition: color .15s, transform .15s;
  }
  .nt-diversify__tile:hover .nt-diversify__go { color: #FF4200; transform: translate(1px,-1px); }
  .nt-diversify__tile b {
    display: block;
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;
    color: #232323; margin-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .nt-diversify__tile small {
    font-family: "Source Sans 3", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;
    color: #7A7A7A;
  }

  @keyframes nt-arrow { 0%,100% { transform: translateX(0); } 50% { transform: translateX(5px); } }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .nt-diversify { padding: 72px 0; }
    .nt-diversify__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .nt-diversify__heading { font-size: 36px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0">

<!-- ============ DIVERSIFICATION CALLOUT — paste this <section> into the page ============ -->
<section class="nt-diversify">
  <div class="nt-diversify__inner">

    <!-- message -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="nt-diversify__heading">Don't Just Trade One Market.<br><span>Trade Where The Volatility Is.</span></h2>
      <p class="nt-diversify__body">When index futures go quiet, volatility shifts — to gold, crude oil, and beyond. Diversifying across futures markets may help you spread risk and stay active no matter what the indices are doing.</p>
      <a class="nt-diversify__cta" href="/learn/why-diversification-in-futures-trading/">Why Diversification Can Be The Key<br>To Futures Trading</a>
    </div>

    <!-- markets breadth (no performance shown) -->
    <div class="nt-diversify__panel">
      <div class="nt-diversify__panelhead"><span>Markets you can trade</span></div>
      <div class="nt-diversify__grid">
        <a class="nt-diversify__tile" href="/futures/futures-contracts/index/">
          <span class="nt-diversify__tiletop">
            <img class="nt-diversify__icon" src="/media/NT/media/images/Icons-and-Logos/BLU_line-chart.png" alt="">
            <span class="nt-diversify__go">↗</span>
          </span>
          <b>Stock indices</b><small>E-mini S&amp;P 500, Nasdaq, Dow</small>
        </a>
        <a class="nt-diversify__tile" href="/futures/futures-contracts/metals/">
          <span class="nt-diversify__tiletop">
            <img class="nt-diversify__icon" src="/media/NT/media/images/Icons-and-Logos/ORNG_gold-bars.png" alt="">
            <span class="nt-diversify__go">↗</span>
          </span>
          <b>Metals</b><small>Gold, silver, copper</small>
        </a>
        <a class="nt-diversify__tile" href="/futures/futures-contracts/energy/">
          <span class="nt-diversify__tiletop">
            <img class="nt-diversify__icon" src="/media/NT/media/images/Icons-and-Logos/ORNG_energy.png" alt="">
            <span class="nt-diversify__go">↗</span>
          </span>
          <b>Energy</b><small>Crude oil, natural gas</small>
        </a>
        <a class="nt-diversify__tile" href="/futures/futures-contracts/agriculture/">
          <span class="nt-diversify__tiletop">
            <img class="nt-diversify__icon" src="/media/NT/media/images/Icons-and-Logos/ORNG_oat.png" alt="">
            <span class="nt-diversify__go">↗</span>
          </span>
          <b>Agriculture</b><small>Corn, soybeans, wheat</small>
        </a>
        <a class="nt-diversify__tile wide" href="/futures/futures-contracts/single-stock-futures/">
          <span class="nt-diversify__tiletop">
            <img class="nt-diversify__icon" src="/media/NT/media/images/Icons-and-Logos/icon_dollar_blue.png" alt="">
            <span class="nt-diversify__go">↗</span>
          </span>
          <b>Single stock futures</b><small>Trade individual equities like Apple, Tesla, Nvidia</small>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

</body>
</html>
</div> </div><section class="section-container section-container--white section-container section-container">  <div class="container">  <div class="row"> <div class="col-md-12"> <div class="fr-view"><h2 style="text-align: center">Why trade futures with NinjaTrader?</h2></div> </div> </div> </div> </section><section class="section-container section-container--white section-container section-container">  <div class="container"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-md-4"> <div class="selling-point1 selling-point1--centered"> <div class="selling-point1__image"> <img src="/media/getmedia/e5974908-1c65-47f3-b246-3366808b3aa7/ORNG_no-minimum.png" alt="Chart icon" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="selling-point1__content"> <h3 class="selling-point1__title">No deposit minimum*</h3> <div><p>Get started with an account size of your choice.<em>&nbsp;</em></p><p><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW125477189 BCX0" id="isPasted" style="font-size: 12px"><em>*A</em></span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW125477189 BCX0"><em><span style="font-size: 12px">CH and debit card transfers are subject to a $5.00 minimum.</span></em></span></p></div>  </div> </div> </div><div class="col-md-4"> <div class="selling-point1 selling-point1--centered"> <div class="selling-point1__image"> <img src="/media/getmedia/7d242bab-8ed9-4c58-bdfb-fcecfb76d014/BLU_Low-Margins.png" alt="Money icon" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="selling-point1__content"> <h3 class="selling-point1__title">Low margins</h3> <div><p>Get started with $50 intraday margins.</p></div>  </div> </div> </div><div class="col-md-4"> <div class="selling-point1 selling-point1--centered"> <div class="selling-point1__image"> <img src="/media/getmedia/24c68cc4-a9e2-46f9-8efe-3fe6529ccf99/ORNG_Low-Commissions.png" alt="Choice icon" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="selling-point1__content"> <h3 class="selling-point1__title">Low commissions</h3> <div><p>Get started with $0.09 per contract.</p></div>  </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section><section class="section-container section-container--white section-container section-container">  <div class="container"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-md-4"> <div class="selling-point1 selling-point1--centered"> <div class="selling-point1__image"> <img src="/media/getmedia/8f388c70-272d-4aef-b828-89938264ff95/BLU_Desktop-Web-and-Mobile.png" alt="Simulate icon" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="selling-point1__content"> <h3 class="selling-point1__title">Desktop, web and mobile</h3> <div><p id="isPasted">Explore our award-winning integrated trading platforms.</p></div>  </div> </div> </div><div class="col-md-4"> <div class="selling-point1 selling-point1--centered"> <div class="selling-point1__image"> <img src="/media/getmedia/e570691f-0a43-4308-b15f-9f333166e10b/ORNG_sim-trade.png" alt="Personalize icon" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="selling-point1__content"> <h3 class="selling-point1__title">Simulated trading</h3> <div><p>Prepare for live trading with FREE unlimited simulated trading.</p></div>  </div> </div> </div><div class="col-md-4"> <div class="selling-point1 selling-point1--centered"> <div class="selling-point1__image"> <img src="/media/getmedia/5218c1ef-ca74-43b0-9308-a88aeaa7506c/BLU_customization.png" alt="gear icon" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="selling-point1__content"> <h3 class="selling-point1__title">Customization</h3> <div><p id="isPasted">Integrate 1,000s of third-party add-ons or develop your own using our C# based development framework.</p></div>  </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section><section class="section-container section-container--white section-container section-container">  <div class="container">  <div class="row"> <div class="col-md-12"> <div class="fr-view"><h2 id="isPasted" style="text-align: center">Get started for free and start trading futures now!</h2><p style="text-align: center"><a class="button button-orange" href="https://account.ninjatrader.com/register" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Get Started</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </section><div class="section-container section-container--white section-container section-container"> <div class="container"><!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>NinjaTrader — New Trader Educational Module</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Sharp:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@24,200,0,0&icon_names=arrow_forward,menu_book,science,smart_display&display=swap">
<style>
  /* ============================================================
     NinjaTrader homepage — New Trader Educational Module (Section 7B)
     Replaces the Apps & Add-Ons section; sits between the Get Started
     CTA strip and the "#1 Rated Broker" section.
     Self-contained: styles namespaced under .nt-edu. Transparent bg.
     ============================================================ */
  .nt-edu *, .nt-edu *::before, .nt-edu *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  .nt-edu {
    position: relative;
    background: transparent;          /* inherits the homepage background */
    padding: 96px 0;
    color: #000;
  }
  .nt-edu__wrap { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }

  .nt-edu__head { text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 56px; }
  .nt-edu__head h2 {
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 36px; line-height: 50.4px; letter-spacing: 0;
    color: #000000; margin: 0; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .nt-edu__head p {
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 18px; line-height: 25.2px; letter-spacing: 0; color: #000000;
    margin: 16px 0 0; text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .nt-edu__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }

  .nt-edu__card {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%;
    background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    border-radius: 2px; padding: 32px;
    transition: transform .15s, box-shadow .15s, border-color .15s;
  }
  .nt-edu__card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
    border-color: #FF4200;
  }
  .nt-edu__card .ms { font-size: 44px; display: block; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .nt-edu__card--orange .ms { color: #FF4200; }
  .nt-edu__card--blue .ms { color: #008CFF; }
  .nt-edu__card h3 {
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25; color: #000; margin: 0 0 10px; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .nt-edu__card p {
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 18px; line-height: 25.2px; letter-spacing: 0; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 28px;
  }
  .nt-edu__cta {
    margin-top: auto; align-self: flex-start;
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px; letter-spacing: 2.8px;
    text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #000000; background: #FF4200;
    padding: 16px 26px; border-radius: 2px;
    text-decoration: none; transition: background .15s, color .15s;
  }
  .nt-edu__cta:hover { background: #DC3900; color: #ffffff; }

  .nt-edu__more { text-align: center; margin-top: 48px; }
  .nt-edu__morelink {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #FF4200; text-decoration: none; transition: color .15s;
  }
  .nt-edu__morelink:hover { color: #DC3900; }
  .nt-edu__morelink .ms { font-size: 18px; }

  .nt-edu__footnote {
    text-align: center; font-family: "Source Sans 3", sans-serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 13px; color: #8A8A8A; margin: 40px 0 0;
  }

  .nt-edu .ms {
    font-family: "Material Symbols Sharp"; font-weight: 200;
    font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 0, 'wght' 200; line-height: 1; display: inline-block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .nt-edu { padding: 64px 0; }
    .nt-edu__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .nt-edu__head h2 { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.2; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0">

<!-- ============ NEW TRADER EDUCATIONAL MODULE — paste this <section> into the page ============ -->
<section class="nt-edu">
  <div class="nt-edu__wrap">

    <div class="nt-edu__head">
      <h2>New to Futures Trading? Start Here.</h2>
      <p>From your first trade to your first live position — our free resources walk you through every step.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nt-edu__grid">

      <div class="nt-edu__card nt-edu__card--orange">
        <span class="ms">smart_display</span>
        <h3>Develop the Trader in You</h3>
        <p>Our free multi-video intro series covers futures basics, types of traders, and how to start your trading journey.</p>
        <a class="nt-edu__cta" href="/futures/learn/develop-the-trader-in-you/">Watch Now</a>
      </div>

      <div class="nt-edu__card nt-edu__card--blue">
        <span class="ms">menu_book</span>
        <h3>How to Trade Futures</h3>
        <p>Learn order types, contract specs, and how margin works — the essentials before placing your first trade.</p>
        <a class="nt-edu__cta" href="/learn/how-to-trade-futures/">Start Learning</a>
      </div>

      <div class="nt-edu__card nt-edu__card--orange">
        <span class="ms">science</span>
        <h3>Practice With a Free Trading Simulator</h3>
        <p>Sharpen your skills in our free futures trading simulation, which comes with live market data for the first 14 days. No minimum funding* required to get started.</p>
        <a class="nt-edu__cta" href="/trading-platform/trading-simulator/">Try the Simulator</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="nt-edu__more">
      <a class="nt-edu__morelink" href="/learn/">See All Learning Resources<span class="ms">arrow_forward</span></a>
    </div>

    <p class="nt-edu__footnote">*ACH and debit card transfers are subject to a $5.00 minimum.</p>

  </div>
</section>

</body>
</html>
</div> </div><section class="section-container section-container--white section-container section-container">  <div class="container"> <div class="side-by-side"> <div class="side-by-side__image"> <img src="/media/getmedia/d269260a-8599-4db3-be47-85aba8e5b5a4/Surface-Studio-desktop-dark-left-2-533px.png" alt="" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="side-by-side__content">  <h2 class="side-by-side__title">Trade futures with the #1 rated futures broker</h2> <div class="side-by-side__text-block blue-checkmark"><p><a href="/about-ninjatrader/" title="">NinjaTrader</a> is a unique futures trading provider, centralizing all the tools and services needed for both new and experienced traders to enter the global futures markets.</p><p>Embark on your trading journey with powerful tools and the on-demand support you need including:</p><ul><li>Professional futures trading platforms to <a href="/trading-platform/free-trading-charts/" title="">create charts</a></li><li>Modern futures brokerage services with access to <a href="/trading-platform/trading-simulator/" title="">free trading simulation</a></li><li>Comprehensive support resources including real-time chat and free premium <a href="/learn/" id="isPasted">trading education tools</a>, including our guide to <a href="/learn/building-a-trading-strategy/" title="">building a trading strategy</a>.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>Sign up to start your simplified and cost-effective futures trading experience.</p></div> <a class="button button-orange" href="https://account.ninjatrader.com/register" target="_blank"> Get Started </a> </div> </div> </div> </section><section class="section-container section-container--white section-container section-container">  <div class="container"> <div class="recent-blogs"> <div class="recent-blogs__title"> <h2>NinjaTrader blogs</h2> <a class="recent-blogs__cta" href="/Futures/Blogs"> <span>View All Posts</span> <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"> <use xlink:href="/assets/dist/images/svg-legend.svg#arrow-rig